## **Pricing philosophy**
 
Price for adoption now. Plan the raise for when proof exists.
 
- €89/seat is right for what can be proven today
 
- When Phase 2 retention data exists and case studies show measurable time saved and deals won, raise to €129/seat
 
- When coordination layer and longitudinal intelligence are live, €149 to €199 is defensible
 
- Do not raise before the retention data justifies it
 
The goal in Phase 1 is not margin optimisation. It is memory penetration. Once memory penetration happens, workflows follow, coordination follows, intelligence follows, dependency follows. That is when expansion revenue becomes inevitable.
 
